    <string name="dialog_message_revoke_authorization_accessbility">"Idan ka ci gaba, kun janye yardar ku zuwa Sharuddan Bayanan Mi Ditto. Za mu daina tattara bayananka na sirri, da bayananka na sirri da aka riga aka tattara kuma aka ajiye za a share su a cikin takamaiman lokacin kamar yadda dokokin ƙa'idodi sai dai ko ana buƙata.
Yayinda Mi Ditto ke ba da sabis ɗinsa dangane da tattara bayananka na sirri da ake buƙata, za a riƙe janyewar izini a matsayin ƙin karɓar sabisin Mi Ditto.
Ya janye izinin yanzu?"</string>
